          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuiha Burahimu tsona kula mlunguni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.6.13+HEB.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 6:13–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achimuamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi, ‘Naapa kpwa dzina rangu mwenye, kpwa kukala ukahenda hivyo na kukaniremeza mwanao wa macheye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 11:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakika nindakujaliya na nindahenda vivyazivyo vikale vinji sana dza viratu nyenyezi za mlunguni na dza viratu mtsanga wa pwani. Uvyazio undamiliki midzi ya maadui gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.3.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 3:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mataifa gosi duniani gandaphaha baraka kpwa sababu ya uvyazio. Higa gosi gandakala kpwa kukala ukanitii.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
